message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. Status: independent research manuscript 1.0, preprint draft, not peer reviewed; simulation of synthetic learners, not evidence about real human learning. Repository: https://github.com/mohamedbechirkefi/streak-learning-retention. Author: Mohamed Bechir Kefi, independent researcher. An AI system (Claude, Anthropic) was used as a disclosed research and development assistant and is not an author. Calibration data: Duolingo half-life regression traces (Settles and Meeder 2016), doi:10.7910/DVN/N8XJME, CC BY-NC 4.0."
title: "When activity and retention diverge: item selection, not daily practice, drives the retention cost of a streak-driven policy in a preregistered learner simulation"
